Circuit: ImaxHi=500

Security: AwareSystem=Active,CabSignal AwareDelay=60 SoundSignalDelay=2.4 MaxHoldTime=1.0 EmergencyBrakeDelay=2.1 CabDependent=Yes RadioStop=Yes EmergencyBrakeWarningSignal=2 MagnetLocation=4.5 
Light: Light=Generator LGeneratorEngine=ElectricSeriesMotor LMaxVoltage=110 LMaxCurrent=155
Clima: Heating=Main HMaxVoltage=400
Power: EnginePower=CurrentCollector CollectorsNo=1 MaxVoltage=4000 MinV=2000 MaxCurrent=1200 MinH=0.38 MaxH=2.4 CSW=1.4 PhysicalLayout=2
 
Blending: MED_amax=1.04 MED_EPVC=No MED_Ncor=No MED_FirstDelayED=2 MED_ScndDelayED=1

Engine: EngineType=ElectricInductionMotor Trans=40:218 dfic=470 dfmax=0.790 p=2 cfu=33.43 cim=10.22 icif=0.67 Uzmax=2340 Uzh=2803 DU=20 I0=10 fcfu=33.5 F0=60 a1=0.0 Pmax=800 Fh=40 Ph=620 Vh0=2 Vh1=5 Imax=322 abed=0 Flat=Yes edep=1.0 InvNo=2 InvCtrCplFlag=255 MotorBlowersSpeed=-29

SpeedControl: SpeedCtrl=Yes SpeedButtons=0|40|50|60|70|80|100|120|140|160 OverrideManual=Yes InitPwr=0.3 MaxPwrVel=5 StartVel=2 VelStep=5 PwrStep=0.1 MinPwr=0.3 MaxPwr=1.0 MinVel=0 MaxVel=160 Offset=-0.5 kPpos=0.1 kPneg=0.4 kIpos=0.06 kIneg=0.06 BrakeIntervention=No PowerUpSpeed=0.3 PowerDownSpeed=0.3

AI: Pantstate=1

